,实际startupAttemptId,实际generation,已验snapshotDigest,已验instanceId]求摘要；namespaceDigest对[用途域,bindingDigest,固定consumer名]求摘要，仅owner确认实例实际namespace匹配该binding后才可提供。不得以真实installId、账户、完整key/path作摘要输入。\"],\"digest_domains\":{\"binding\":\"rehearsal-observation-binding\",\"namespace\":\"rehearsal-observation-namespace\"},\"log_policy\":\"drop\",\"method\":\"readRehearsalStorageObservation\",\"purpose\":\"isolated_private_device_evidence\",\"response_schema\":\"rehearsal_storage_observation\"},\"runtime_config_error_codes\":{\"runtime_config_activation_identity_mismatch\":\"request/package/manifest 三方身份不一致。\",\"runtime_config_activation_readback_failed\":\"写入后 active readback 校验失败。\",\"runtime_config_activation_receipt_malformed\":\"active receipt 解码或结构非法。\",\"runtime_config_activation_receipt_mismatch\":\"active receipt 与 active package 身份不一致。\",\"runtime_config_activation_receipt_missing\":\"active receipt 文件缺失。\",\"runtime_config_activation_receipt_read_failed\":\"active receipt 读取 IO 失败。\",\"runtime_config_activation_receipt_write_failed\":\"receipt 原子写入失败。\",\"runtime_config_activation_request_digest_invalid\":\"host 传入的 request digest 格式非法。\",\"runtime_config_activation_request_digest_mismatch\":\"request canonical 摘要与 host 声明不一致。\",\"runtime_config_activation_request_malformed\":\"activation request 解码或字段集非法。\",\"runtime_config_activation_request_missing\":\"activation request 文件缺失。\",\"runtime_config_activation_request_read_failed\":\"activation request 读取 IO 失败。\",\"runtime_config_activation_requires_cold_start\":\"activation 只允许冷启动原生 gate 消费。\",\"runtime_config_activation_rollback_failed\":\"失败回滚未完成或 CAS 后状态未知。\",\"runtime_config_activation_write_failed\":\"active package 原子写入失败。\",\"runtime_config_active_digest_conflict\":\"expectedActiveDigest 与当前 active digest CAS 冲突。\",\"runtime_config_content_source_mismatch\":\"文档类型、环境和内容源策略不一致。\",\"runtime_config_digest_unavailable\":\"平台摘要原语不可用。\",\"runtime_config_effective_manifest_digest_mismatch\":\"effectiveLaunchManifest 摘要